OL,3,GNEWSADUP urges Irish government not to
OL,4,Aintervene in Drumcree dispute
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Democratic Unionist Party (DUP) has
OL,7,Furged the Irish government not to
OL,8,Fintervene in the Drumcree dispute after
OL,9,Fcalls for the Taoiseach (Irish Prime
OL,10,FMinister) Micheal Martin to meet
OL,11,FGarvaghy Road residents.
OL,13,FOn Thursday, Portadown Orange District
OL,14,Fsaid on social media that the Parades
OL,15,FCommission had appointed a surprise
OL,16,Fmediation facilitator for the dispute.
OL,18,FSinn Fein MLA John O'Dowd said he was
OL,19,Fconcerned there had been no visible
OL,20,Fengagement from the Irish government on
OL,21,Fthe issue.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
