OL,3,GNEWSADUP urges Irish government not to
OL,4,Aintervene in Drumcree dispute
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe earliest date for a decision by the
OL,7,FParades Commission on the planned
OL,8,FDrumcree march by Portadown Orange
OL,9,FOrder is 23 September ` four days
OL,10,Fbefore the scheduled parade.
